<http://data.silknow.org/object/f61fffd7-9979-3f80-99cc-3c6a82b1dc73>
        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Woven silk and metal thread.\nStriped pattern:\n[1] light blue ground with a line of red triangular flowers above green leaves offset with two half motifs. [2] wider strip with an undecorated gold ground [silver strip open S-wound on a white silk core]. [3] as [1]. [4] wider stripe with worn metal ground as [2] and a line of a stylized floral  motif: round, red flower above a pair of red birds with blue wings sitting on a branch which ends with three green leaves and from which hangs a bell-like red and blue flower; red stylized roots.\nThere is a woven inscription across the top of the main piece. The end has been folded under. There is a selvedge down the right hand side which has been turned under and stitched."@en ;
        ecrm:P138i_has_representation  <http://data.silknow.org/image/4ec7a01f-eadb-31a8-96d1-42a886323adc> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/174c7c5f-0f18-3acb-9cee-2d965028bae0> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/20ac51c7-6be8-363d-bff0-7d0e829f28fd> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/e49216f3-a9d7-3a45-846c-fd67168f789e> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/175acc75-d153-314d-acb5-00108f0b1928> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/d7412d55-2fc8-34cc-987b-21741fb714bb> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/58a11df4-2eb4-3927-8bc5-f9b2e644af8a> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/186a7b3c-f800-3bfc-aa6d-d772848ad475> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/50d1c7df-d4db-320e-891c-6b84fee68cdb> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note               "Woven silk and metal thread.\nStriped pattern:\n[1] light blue ground with a line of red triangular flowers above green leaves offset with two half motifs. [2] wider strip with an undecorated gold ground [silver strip open S-wound on a white silk core]. [3] as [1]. [4] wider stripe with worn metal ground as [2] and a line of a stylized floral  motif: round, red flower above a pair of red birds with blue wings sitting on a branch which ends with three green leaves and from which hangs a bell-like red and blue flower; red stylized roots.\nThere is a woven inscription across the top of the main piece. The end has been folded under. There is a selvedge down the right hand side which has been turned under and stitched."@en ;
